Z||000000||sid1200||07-07-99||09:33 PM||||hi anyone know where I can get a sunroof storage case and sunshade (also how does the sunshade attach)<br>and is it possible to store the roof under the hood (I think that is the proper loc) without the bag?<p>thanks<br>sid
Z||000001||theogre||07-08-99||09:52 AM||||I don't think you can store it in the front with the bag on it. The front storage brackets are setup to store the glass without the bag. The bag would add thickness to the pannel, and unless it has cuttouts for the hinges, there's just no way. The hinges have to slip under the front brackets, with the glass resting on them.
Z||000002||theogre||07-08-99||10:06 AM||||if you don't have the brackets in the front compartment, DO NOT put the glass up their period. It won't have good support and will likely break when it bounces against something hard. <p>If you don't have the brackets, or they are damaged, you can get replacements from a scrap yard. they just bolt in. There should also be a foam rubber bumper(s) on the bottom side of the hood. the bumper is there to keep the back side of the glass from bouncing on the rear storage bracket.
